OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for charity theft at
OL,4,Asnooker star's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after he admitted
OL,7,Fburgling the home of former world
OL,8,Fsnooker champion Kyren Wilson.
OL,10,FHigh-value jewellery, luxury watches,
OL,11,Fdesigner handbags and cash destined for
OL,12,Fa children's cancer charity were taken
OL,13,Ffrom his house near Kettering on 22
OL,14,FJune, according to Northamptonshire
OL,15,FPolice.
OL,17,FKane Lee, 28, of Albert Road, Luton,
OL,18,Fhad initially denied the charge of
OL,19,Fburglary, but changed his plea to
OL,20,Fguilty at a hearing at Northampton
OL,21,FCrown Court.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
